apnews.com,https://apnews.com,https://apnews.com/article/india-police-shooting-cow-smuggling-muslims-takeaways-01d24272a39d3f4af1248863c21f6032,,The AP investigated police shootings of alleged cow smugglers in India. Here's what to know,"An Associated Press investigation found that police in India’s most populous state have repeatedly shot suspects in the leg, many of them Muslims accused of cow smuggling. Research shared exclusively with AP documented nearly 650 such shootings in Uttar Pradesh since 2020. Separately, data obtained by AP showed Muslims accounted for a disproportionate number — over a third — of suspects killed by Uttar Pradesh police over the last decade. Police say officers act in self-defense and attribute the high number of Muslims shot to their prevalence in the cattle trade. Activists say the practice is spreading to other states. Human rights advocates and judges warn that the shootings undermine India’s rule of law.",Erika Kinetz,2026-10-23T03:08:01Z,2026-10-23T06:50:29.399971+00:00,https://apnews.com/article/india-police-shooting-cow-smuggling-muslims-takeaways-01d24272a39d3f4af1248863c21f6032,playwright
